flowchart LR
    display[需要顯示畫面] --> dirty{內容是否改變？}
    dirty -- 是 --> render[重新繪製<br/>並更新 ColorBuffer]
    dirty -- 否 --> restore[由 ColorBuffer 還原]
    render --> screen[顯示結果]
    restore --> screen

    classDef decision fill:#fff9df,stroke:#806f27,color:#111,stroke-width:1px;
    class dirty decision;
